      "title": "Getting to Ascott Raffles Place Singapore",
      "description": "<p><strong>By Taxi<br /></strong>From Singapore Changi Airport, the journey takes approximately 25 minutes and costs around SGD 25.<br /><br /><strong>By Mass Rapid Transport (MRT)</strong> <br />Take the MRT to Raffles Place MRT station, which takes approximately 35 minutes. From there, exit from Exit I, turn left following the pathway to Ascott Raffles Place Singapore in 1 minute.</p>"
    },
    "public_transport": {
      "title": "Nearest public transport from Ascott Raffles Place Singapore",
      "description": "<strong>Raffles Place MRT Station (North-South Line and East-West Line)</strong><br />It takes approximately 1 minute walk and about 120m away from the serviced apartment. <br /><br /><strong>Telok Ayer MRT Station (Downtown Line) <br /></strong>It takes approximately 5 minutes walk and about 400m away from the serviced apartment."
